==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*6 [[UltraBaaBaa]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*4 [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Elizabeth the LVIth]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Oldstrich]] spawns as the boss.
**6 [[UltraBaaBaa]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
**2 [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**5 [[Zomboe]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
**1 [[Elizabeth the LVIth]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use the UltraBaaBaas' Barriers to stack a large amount of [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cats]] to kill the Oldstrich before Elizabeth spawns. The [[Ototo Corps#Breakerblast|Breakerblast]] Cannon can give you the control needed to prevent too many UltraBaaBaas from stacking up and overrunning you. Once Oldstrich is dead, kill Elizabeth with a [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cats]] to clear the stage.

